      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start, it definitely captures the mood. \n\nHowever, I just ran it through our tool and the richness score came back a bit lower than I was hoping for. The creative director wants this to feel incredibly \"maximalist\" and lush. \n\nCould you do another pass? Try to expand on the descriptions to really push that unique adjective count higher. Just remember: keep it sounding like a high-end luxury brand. It needs to stay sophisticated and seamless, not just a bunch of random words thrown together. There's no need to overdo it, but let's see if we can get a much higher score while maintaining that elegance.",
      "source": "evaluator"
